<title>UK: GrandMet full year profits up six percent.</title>
<headline>GrandMet full year profits up six percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year ended September 30, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		31.0		   vs 28.8</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 15.9		   vs 14.9</p>
<p> Pretax		     965.0		  vs 920.0</p>
<p> Operating profit	 1.108 bln	    vs 910.0 bln</p>
<p> Turnover		   8.974 bln	    vs 8.025 bln</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 948 and 999 million stg. Average exchange rate sterling-dollar at 1.54 compared with 1.58 in 1995.</p>
<p>Full company name - Grand Metropolitan Plc</p>
</text>
